{"title":"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 3","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div id=\"toc\" class=\"toc\" role=\"navigation\" aria-labelledby=\"mw-toc-heading\"><input type=\"checkbox\" role=\"button\" id=\"toctogglecheckbox\" class=\"toctogglecheckbox\" style=\"display:none\" /><div class=\"toctitle\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2 id=\"mw-toc-heading\">Contents</h2><span class=\"toctogglespan\"><label class=\"toctogglelabel\" for=\"toctogglecheckbox\"></label></span></div>\n<ul>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-1\"><a href=\"#Problem\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">1</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Problem</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-2\"><a href=\"#Solution_1\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">2</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 1</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-3\"><a href=\"#Solution_2:_Substitution\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">3</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 2: Substitution</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-4\"><a href=\"#Solution_3\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">4</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 3</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-5\"><a href=\"#Solution_4\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">5</span> <span class=\"toctext\">Solution 4</span></a></li>\n<li class=\"toclevel-1 tocsection-6\"><a href=\"#See_also\"><span class=\"tocnumber\">6</span> <span class=\"toctext\">See also</span></a></li>\n</ul>\n</div>\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/3/a/43a3d7db54653ccc7900248182e376a385bed739.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(\\log_2 x)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"64\" height=\"19\" /> if <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/9/6/596b587397d4aafb39b8f1b02a0a5e4c9a744110.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2 (\\log_8 x) = \\log_8 (\\log_2 x)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"201\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_1\">Solution 1</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 1\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Raise both as <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Exponent\" title=\"Exponent\">exponents</a> with base 8:\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/9/a0947a3442ea41bef7ae8dc2258273f759334198.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} 8^{\\log_2 (\\log_8 x)} &amp;= 8^{\\log_8 (\\log_2 x)}\\\\ 2^{3 \\log_2(\\log_8x)} &amp;= \\log_2x\\\\ (\\log_8x)^3 &amp;= \\log_2x\\\\ \\left(\\frac{\\log_2x}{\\log_28}\\right)^3 &amp;= \\log_2x\\\\ (\\log_2x)^2 &amp;= (\\log_28)^3 = \\boxed{027}\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"238\" height=\"161\" />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>A quick explanation of the steps: On the 1st step, we use the property of <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Logarithm\" title=\"Logarithm\">logarithms</a> that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/2/9/729165c347c85e36ea691369ce62a569e7dd43c9.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a^{\\log_a x} = x$\" width=\"79\" height=\"15\" />. On the 2nd step, we use the fact that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/b/a/9bada64dfe386904aa6659f3157d89a7fcd911ff.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\log_a x = \\log_a x^k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"134\" height=\"20\" />. On the 3rd step, we use the <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=Change_of_base_formula\" title=\"Change of base formula\">change of base formula</a>, which states <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/9/5/f956b72aabe7f0f2e86d67c2582aafd67512496e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a b = \\frac{\\log_k b}{\\log_k a}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"113\" height=\"42\" /> for arbitrary <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/c/3/8c325612684d41304b9751c175df7bcc0f61f64f.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"12\" height=\"14\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_2:_Substitution\">Solution 2: Substitution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 2: Substitution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>We wish to convert this expression into one which has a uniform base. Let's scale down all the powers of 8 to 2. \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/0/4/a04791169d8d9b03b2b9ad6149d149aae023b162.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} {\\log_2 (\\frac{1}{3}\\log_2 x)} &amp;= \\frac{1}{3}{\\log_2 (\\log_2 x)}\\\\ {\\log_2 x = y}\\\\ {\\log_2 (\\frac{1}{3}y)} &amp;= \\frac{1}{3}{\\log_2 (y)}\\\\ {3\\log_2 (\\frac{1}{3}y)} &amp;= {\\log_2 (y)}\\\\  {\\log_2 (\\frac{1}{3}y)^3} &amp;= {\\log_2 (y)}\\\\  \\end{align*}\" width=\"230\" height=\"193\" />\nSolving, we get <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/d/6/dd60949e78c5e5c15917ea089fbe8c5f247643b7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y^2 = 27$\" style=\"vertical-align: -3px\" width=\"59\" height=\"18\" />, which is what we want. \n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/4/c/74c53cf1ee0e5e31d7791ca7394346930c8a03dd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\boxed{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"30\" height=\"23\" />\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Just a quick note- \nIn this solution, we used 2 important rules of logarithm:\n1) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/6/0/360f8cead4e9aea7f85980b377bab5ca7740daa0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_a b^n=n\\log_a b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"132\" height=\"17\" />.\n2) <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/8/54811c54e1971ed023e1ac08bd22805829e5ca78.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{a^n} b=\\frac{1}{n}\\log_a b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"135\" height=\"37\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_3\">Solution 3</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=4\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 3\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>First we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/7/2/3726465bd0b0d08edc5b91f1d15d57533085028a.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\log_2(\\log_8x)&amp;=\\log_8(\\log_2x)\\\\ \\frac{\\log_2(\\log_8x)}{\\log_8(\\log_2x)}&amp;=1 \\end{align*}\" width=\"203\" height=\"69\" />\nChanging the base in the numerator yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/a/2/8a2c237dc99027e9e83ca2fbf3c2812da19e9d37.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\frac{3\\log_8(\\log_8x)}{\\log_8(\\log_2x)}&amp;=1\\\\ \\frac{\\log_8(\\log_8x)}{\\log_8(\\log_2x)}&amp;=\\frac{1}{3}\\\\ \\end{align*}\" width=\"139\" height=\"92\" />\nUsing the property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/8/3/6835bd75b43934e1db81a411d8375fd11ec8ca75.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_ab}{\\log_ac}=\\log_cb$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"112\" height=\"42\" /> yields\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/d/6/8d6cdc5997b7586ff9c549f81d2fff1734d67f4b.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\begin{align*} \\log_{\\log_2x}(\\log_8x)&amp;=\\frac{1}{3}\\\\ (\\log_2x)^\\frac{1}{3}&amp;=\\log_8x\\\\ \\sqrt[3]{\\log_2x}&amp;=\\frac{\\log_2x}{3} \\end{align*}\" width=\"186\" height=\"111\" />\nNow setting <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/6/e/b6e1ca153642330611cf08583070fafaa4b0d351.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\log_2x$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"78\" height=\"17\" />, we have\n<img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/f/f/8ff63c46f774d903f0700fd13df9abad02b160d2.png\" class=\"latexcenter\" alt=\"\\[\\sqrt[3]{y}=\\frac{y}{3}\\]\" width=\"60\" height=\"32\" />\nSolving gets <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/7/4/774b4edf38e70cb82e30ff1e821886ec1a4d2b8a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y=\\log_2x=3\\sqrt{3}\\Longrightarrow(\\log_2x)^2=(3\\sqrt{3})^2=\\boxed{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"374\" height=\"23\" />.\n</p><p>~ Nafer\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution_4\">Solution 4</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=5\" title=\"Edit section: Solution 4\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Say that <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/d/0/cd0aee7dc1772adea7102bd499e88bffc07e6f9d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{2^3}x=a$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"84\" height=\"17\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/1/b/81b9ad9f133d872b96c65fcb5e182a60e7d1a059.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2x=b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"76\" height=\"17\" /> so we have <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/3/f/8/3f82db71711e199279551b8f0fc9d30b98918eba.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_2a=\\log_{2^3}b$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"116\" height=\"17\" />. And we want <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/a/1/d/a1d03c3c5b9abf1bdb0c9df06fe5fb11ae13d0e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"17\" />.\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/e/d/7ed4fc815c61ebd1c205932237b49cbfa30978bd.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\\\ \\log_2a=\\frac13 \\log_{2}b \\ \\ \\text{\\tiny{(step 1)}}\\\\ \\frac{\\log_2a}{\\log_{2}b}=\\log_ba=\\frac13\\\\ b^{1/3}=a.$\" width=\"174\" height=\"98\" />\n</p><p>Because <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/2/b/3/2b3c035642a2c69de88324a449a2180eda90d7f8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$3a=b$\" width=\"51\" height=\"12\" /> (as <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/4/e/54e5a7cb9640d78e7e90d9bd3357698906ae773b.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^{3a}=x$\" width=\"58\" height=\"15\" /> and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/d/f/5/df537d7861f5f912a5939c65c52a10cf0b2263e8.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$2^b=x$\" width=\"50\" height=\"15\" /> from our setup), we have that \n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/0/5/8057940545cdd3c157007c6c25d8a619e4f54273.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$b^{1/3}=\\frac{b}{3}\\\\ b^{-2/3}=\\frac13\\\\ b=3^{3/2}\\\\ \\\\b^2=3^3=\\boxed{27}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"110\" height=\"138\" />\n</p><p>~thedodecagon\n</p>\n<hr />\n<p>Note that we use the property <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/d/6/bd62ddda52ff22870436473fb6544e3585e9a4d0.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\log_{x^n}y=\\frac1n\\log_xy$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"138\" height=\"37\" /> in step 1 and <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/9/c/4/9c4bdb6185ddc0e42d377fcccc610d3315508c64.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\frac{\\log_wx}{\\log_wy}=\\log_yx$\" style=\"vertical-align: -17px\" width=\"120\" height=\"42\" /> in step 2 in this solution.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_3&amp;action=edit&amp;section=6\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; width:80%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME\" title=\"1988 AIME\">1988 AIME </a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems\">Problems</a></b> • <b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Answer_Key\" title=\"1988 AIME Answer Key\">Answer Key</a></b> • <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"http://www.artofproblemsolving.com/Forum/resources.php?c=182&amp;cid=45&amp;year=1988\">Resources</a>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">Problem 2</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">Problem 4</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_1\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 1\">1</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_2\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 2\">2</a> <b>•</b> <a class=\"mw-selflink selflink\">3</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_4\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 4\">4</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_5\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 5\">5</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_6\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 6\">6</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_7\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 7\">7</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_8\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 8\">8</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_9\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 9\">9</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_10\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 10\">10</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_11\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 11\">11</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_12\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 12\">12</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_13\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 13\">13</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_14\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 14\">14</a> <b>•</b> <a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=1988_AIME_Problems/Problem_15\" title=\"1988 AIME Problems/Problem 15\">15</a>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td align=\"center\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=AIME_Problems_and_Solutions\" title=\"AIME Problems and Solutions\"> All AIME Problems and Solutions</a></b>\n</td></tr></tbody></table>\n<div class=\"print\">\n<div style=\"display:flex;width:100%;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center\">\n<div>\n<p><span class=\"mw-default-size\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:AMC_Logo.png\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/d/d1/AMC_Logo.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"97\" height=\"84\" class=\"mw-file-element\" /></a></span>\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex-grow:1;text-align:right\">\n<p>These problems are copyrighted &#169; by the <a rel=\"nofollow\" class=\"external text\" href=\"https://www.maa.org\">Mathematical Association of America</a>. \n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"clear:both;\"></div>\n</div></div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261016205749\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [show‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.043 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.065 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 235/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 1766/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 88/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 3/100\nExpensive parser function count: 0/100\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 6394/5000000 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expansion time report (%,ms,calls,template)\n100.00%   13.338      1 -total\n 58.72%    7.832      1 Template:AIME_box\n 39.65%    5.289      1 Template:MAA_Notice\n-->\n\n<!-- Saved in parser cache with key wiki-wiki_:pcache:2845:|#|:idhash:canonical and timestamp 20261016205749 and revision id 137733. Rendering was triggered because: page-view\n -->\n</div>"}